PicoClaw is a lightweight personal AI assistant written in Go. It runs as
a single binary (agent CLI, gateway, Pico WebSocket channel) with JSON
config under ~/.picoclaw.

Official goreleaser builds do not include OpenBSD. This port compiles
cmd/picoclaw from a pinned GitHub commit (CGO_ENABLED=0, goolm+stdjson)
so the package matches the base libc on -current/8.0.

https://github.com/sipeed/picoclaw
